<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-008" chapter-id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu" source-id="s-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu">
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:expedition" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">建武將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:expedition:m0004" ref="1zh_x1q_p1x_A">袁喬</persName>伐蜀，拜表輒行。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:annal-days" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三年春三月乙卯，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:annal-days:m0008" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>攻成都，克之。丁亥，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:annal-days:m0020" ref="agn_6ch_sus">李勢</persName>降</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:revolt" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">蜀人<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:revolt:m0002" ref="8gn_lan_705">鄧定</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:revolt:m0005" ref="n8f_6a0_x73">隗文</persName>舉兵反，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:revolt:m0011" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>又擊破之，使益州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:revolt:m0023" ref="smf_swf_i2l">周撫</persName>鎮彭模。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:rank" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋八月，進安西將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-shu:rank:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲征西大將軍、開府儀同三司，封臨賀郡公</p>
</text>
